# Project Context — DGTN / Dr. David Ogbueli

A faith-based ministry website for **Dr. David Ogbueli** (David Ogbueli Global
Transformation Network). It presents his teachings, books, media, ministries,
and partnership/giving, plus a "Start Here" conversational-AI onboarding (Debbie).

## Non-negotiables

- **Static-first.** The whole site is a Next.js **static export** (`output: "export"`).
  There is no application server at runtime. See [architecture](architecture.mdc).
- **One deploy path:** push to GitHub `main` → Cloudflare Pages auto-builds and
  publishes. Never rely on local `wrangler pages deploy`. See [git-workflow](git-workflow.mdc).
- **Surgical edits.** Don't redesign sections you weren't asked to touch. Match the
  patterns already in the file. See [coding-style](coding-style.mdc).
- **Next.js 16 is not the Next.js you know.** Read `node_modules/next/dist/docs/`
  before changing Next-specific behavior (async `params`, image handling, etc.).

